    <section class="panel">
      <div class="eyebrow">YOUR INFORMATION</div>
      <h1>Privacy notice</h1>

      <p>
        This notice explains how the independent loan service may collect
        and use personal information when you apply for a loan.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
      <p>
        We may collect your name, phone number, email address, requested
        loan amount, repayment period and stated loan purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>2. How we use your information</h2>
      <p>
        Information may be used to receive and review applications, verify
        that an application was submitted by you, contact you about your
        application and maintain required service records.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Sharing information</h2>
      <p>
        Information should only be shared with authorized staff and
        service providers where necessary to operate the service, protect
        it, or meet legal obligations. Access should be limited and
        protected.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Security</h2>
      <p>
        Reasonable technical and organizational safeguards must be used
        to protect personal information. No online system can guarantee
        absolute security.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on applicable law, you may have rights to request access
        to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information, and
        to raise a concern about how it is handled.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Contact the service</h2>
      <p>
        Before accepting real applications, the operator must add its
        registered legal name, physical or postal address, privacy contact
        details, retention periods and a working process for privacy
        requests to this notice.
      </p>

      <div class="notice">
        This is a starter template, not a completed legal privacy policy.
        The service operator must review and complete it for compliance
        with applicable Kenyan data-protection requirements before
        collecting real customer information.
      </div>

      <a class="btn secondary" href="index.html">Back to home</a>
    </section>

